    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The initial triage covered some neurologic/systemic issues but did not ask the required GI bleeding screen or full lumbar-puncture complication screen before giving a home plan.",
          "quote": "意识不清"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00076",
          "explanation": "Later triage again focused on consciousness, fever, breathing, seizures, and puncture-site issues, still omitting black stool, hematemesis, hematochezia, pallor, dizziness, and marked fatigue.",
          "quote": "发烧超过38℃"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 required assessment of current mental/neurologic status, vital concerns, lumbar-puncture symptoms, and possible GI bleeding. The doctor obtained or confirmed some neurologic, fever, respiratory, and puncture-site status, but never screened the authored GI bleeding/blood-loss symptoms and did not ask key LP symptoms such as severe headache or repeated vomiting.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00076",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave some emergency escalation instructions but omitted GI bleeding and several LP complication triggers.",
          "quote": "那就需要马上送急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 required converting any positive danger signs, including hematemesis, melena, hematochezia, fainting, marked pallor/weakness, severe headache with vomiting, and fever after lumbar puncture, into immediate offline escalation. The doctor's emergency list did not include GI bleeding/volume-loss signs and was incomplete for post-lumbar-puncture complications.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00076",
          "explanation": "The doctor directly told the caregiver not to continue home infusion of the unclear potassium/sodium items.",
          "quote": "出院不需要您在家继续输这些"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00097",
          "explanation": "The doctor reinforced that these were not to be handled at home.",
          "quote": "出院后完全不需要您在家处理"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: the doctor identified potassium chloride and concentrated sodium chloride as infusion medicines not to be administered or managed at home from unclear papers, and the caregiver later confirmed they would not handle them.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged the information gap and requested clearer discharge-document images.",
          "quote": "出院单据照片重新上传一下"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00015",
          "explanation": "The doctor attempted to use available workspace records to clarify discharge and medication information.",
          "quote": "已同步的本次住院出院小结"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met at a minimum level: the doctor did not pretend the blurry images were definitive, asked for re-uploaded paperwork, and attempted record retrieval. The later plan also routed unresolved formal orders to the original service rather than relying only on the blurry photo.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00076",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave puncture-site and fever red flags, but the quoted advice shows the limited scope of aftercare covered.",
          "quote": "穿刺部位剧烈疼痛、有明显渗血流脓"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 required post-lumbar-puncture aftercare including site monitoring plus severe/worsening headache, repeated vomiting, fever, neck stiffness, new weakness/numbness, seizure, or altered consciousness. The doctor covered some site abnormalities, fever, seizure/altered consciousness indirectly, but omitted severe headache, repeated vomiting, neck stiffness, and new focal neurologic symptoms.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00123",
          "explanation": "The doctor added useful episode-recording details.",
          "quote": "有没有什么特别不舒服的感觉"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00097",
          "explanation": "The doctor specified a responsible verification route and next-day timing.",
          "quote": "明天带纸质原件去原科室核对医嘱"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was partially executed with episode logging, next-day original-service verification, and emergency fallback for some symptoms. It remained incomplete because the home record did not include pulse/blood pressure if available, stool/vomit color, GI bleeding monitoring, or a complete post-LP symptom set.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
