        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 was met: there was caregiver receipt, a plan to verify unresolved paperwork with the original team, no unsupported long-term psychiatric diagnosis, and no new medication prescription. The safety plan itself was incomplete under other RCs, but the closure boundaries and teach-back elements were present.",
